<title>UK: BOE says 94.3 pct of 2013-2017 UK stock converted.</title>
<headline>BOE says 94.3 pct of 2013-2017 UK stock converted.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said on Thursday that 94.3 percent of the one billion stg of 12.0 percent stock due 2013-2017 has been converted into the 8.0 percent gilt due 2015.  </p>
<p>The total amount of the 8.0 percent stock due 2015 outstanding following the conversion is 13,787,097,390.32 stg.</p>
<p>The total amount of 2013-2017 stock outstanding following the conversion is 57,416,776.87 stg.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7715</p>
</text>
